2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2023 Q1","e":"cpng","d":"2023-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bom Kim","x":"In other words, without raising prices to increase margins, rolling back benefits, or compromising service levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/coupang-cpng-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2023 Q1","e":"cpng","d":"2023-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bom Kim","x":"It was also not driven by onetime cost-cutting measures like layoffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/coupang-cpng-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2023 Q1","e":"cpng","d":"2023-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bom Kim","x":"We did this by streamlining operations and reducing waste, all while expanding selection and delivering nearly all fresh orders via dawn and same-day delivery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/09/coupang-cpng-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2023 Q2","e":"cpng","d":"2023-08-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bom Kim","x":"It's consistent with the strategy that we've always held, and we'll continue to invest in AI teams and tools to drive efficiencies and enhance the customer experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/coupang-cpng-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2023 Q4","e":"cpng","d":"2024-02-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Bom Kim","x":"We also see this engagement pattern with Play our video streaming service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/27/coupang-cpng-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2023 Q4","e":"cpng","d":"2024-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gaurav Anand","x":"We probably will take a onetime restructuring charge in Q1 and we'll split it out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/27/coupang-cpng-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2024 Q1","e":"cpng","d":"2024-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"James Lee","x":"Two over here, First, can you guys talk about your AI investments?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/07/coupang-cpng-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2024 Q1","e":"cpng","d":"2024-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gaurav Anand","x":"This change was primarily due to the inclusion of Farfetch whose expenses also include $58 million of one-time costs this quarter relating to the acquisition and subsequent restructuring activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/07/coupang-cpng-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2024 Q1","e":"cpng","d":"2024-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gaurav Anand","x":"Our consolidated operations generated $281 million of adjusted EBITDA this quarter, this does not include the one-time costs relating to the acquisition and subsequent restructuring activities in Farfetch.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/07/coupang-cpng-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2024 Q2","e":"cpng","d":"2024-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Bom Kim","x":"Not including the savings they get on free returns, exclusive discounts, free video streaming, and not to mention hours they save from skipping trips to the store to better spend with their children.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/coupang-cpng-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2024 Q2","e":"cpng","d":"2024-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gaurav Anand","x":"This change was primarily due to the inclusion of Farfetch and its related restructuring costs, as well as the estimated $121 million administrative fine that we accrued as announced by the Korea Fair Trade Commission.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/coupang-cpng-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CPNG 2024 Q